          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why has my tracking stopped updating?",
            "answer": "<p>Packages are not always scanned at every stage of their journey. This means your order may still be moving even if the tracking page hasn’t changed recently.</p><p>Temporary pauses can also happen because of customs processing, weather conditions, peak-season volume, or delays at a local carrier facility.</p><p>If your tracking has not changed for <strong>10–15 days</strong>, please reach out through our <strong>Contact Us</strong> page and include your order number and tracking number. Our support team will check the shipment and help you with the next steps.</p>"
          }
